repository-code: "https://github.com/docxology/Cascadian_Synergetics"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-23
abstract: >-
  Two playable patrols through a fog-bound Cascadian redwood grove, built around
  the Office of Synergetics Services gallery: a first-person Three.js field
  station and a 2.5D storybook patrol. Synergetic geometry (the jitterbug,
  quadray coordinates, the isotropic vector matrix, tensegrity) is shown in play
  rather than explained.
keywords:
  - synergetics
  - Buckminster Fuller
  - quadray coordinates
  - jitterbug
  - isotropic vector matrix
  - tensegrity
  - Cascadia
  - coast redwoods
  - game
